(3580992, 500496, 3102, '<td valign="top">This seems like one of those shots that may have been just fine coming straight from the camera, and the editing kinda blew things.  Why the weird purple tint?  Why the tilt?  Why the soft focus?  These just seem like some unusual decisions for what might have been an otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'This seems like one of those shots that may have been just fine coming straight from the camera, and the editing kinda blew things.  Why the weird purple tint?  Why the tilt?  Why the soft focus?  These just seem like some unusual decisions for what might have been an otherwise nice shot.', '2007-04-25 10:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
