(3581056, 502048, 62378, '<td valign="top">I love the emotion conveyed in this picture. Great composition too</td>', 'I love the emotion conveyed in this picture. Great composition too', '2007-04-25 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581062, 500763, 62378, '<td valign="top">Oh wow... great find! Very, very cool.</td>', 'Oh wow... great find! Very, very cool.', '2007-04-25 11:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581065, 502107, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I like the color and lighting.  I think there are a couple of things that do take way from the photo.  The barge at the upper third being cut off distracts from the barge in the lower third.  The cut off tree on the left side is kinda distracting also.  There isn''t much of a wow factor either.  All in all I''m giving it a 5 because it''s not a bad photo just not great.</td>', 'I like the idea. I like the color and lighting.  I think there are a couple of things that do take way from the photo.  The barge at the upper third being cut off distracts from the barge in the lower third.  The cut off tree on the left side is kinda distracting also.  There isn''t much of a wow factor either.  All in all I''m giving it a 5 because it''s not a bad photo just not great.', '2007-04-25 11:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581066, 501646, 62378, '<td valign="top">Try a larger aperature (if possible with the lighting conditions) to get more of the flowers in focus to limit distractions.</td>', 'Try a larger aperature (if possible with the lighting conditions) to get more of the flowers in focus to limit distractions.', '2007-04-25 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581075, 501008, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I think your border actually takes away from the photo in a couple of ways.  It looks like you are trying to use the border to make it fit the thirds challenge (which may not be the case, but that is what it looks like).  And also your overlaps into the border and can still be seen.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I think your border actually takes away from the photo in a couple of ways.  It looks like you are trying to use the border to make it fit the thirds challenge (which may not be the case, but that is what it looks like).  And also your overlaps into the border and can still be seen.', '2007-04-25 11:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581084, 501617, 56828, '<td valign="top">Could use a sharpening.  But I still like it.</td>', 'Could use a sharpening.  But I still like it.', '2007-04-25 11:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581085, 501916, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great action shot...amazing.</td>', 'Great action shot...amazing.', '2007-04-25 11:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581087, 502264, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is really well done!  Superb composition.  Meets the challenge well.  Excellent clarity, exposure and color.  (10)</td>', 'This is really well done!  Superb composition.  Meets the challenge well.  Excellent clarity, exposure and color.  (10)', '2007-04-25 11:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
