(3581335, 501603, 62095, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement however I am not so sure of the partial silhouette over the couple, I think I would have liked either more or less detail there.  As it is I kinda have an impression that the man has no clothes on his bottom half.  So yeah, not sure really.</td>', 'I like the arrangement however I am not so sure of the partial silhouette over the couple, I think I would have liked either more or less detail there.  As it is I kinda have an impression that the man has no clothes on his bottom half.  So yeah, not sure really.', '2007-04-25 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581341, 502442, 62095, '<td valign="top">A good, clear shot.</td>', 'A good, clear shot.', '2007-04-25 12:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581361, 501036, 62095, '<td valign="top">I may have been tempted by some renovation here to the right hand window to get a bit more symmetry by removing the obscuring plank.  That aside though this is a neat idea.</td>', 'I may have been tempted by some renovation here to the right hand window to get a bit more symmetry by removing the obscuring plank.  That aside though this is a neat idea.', '2007-04-25 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
