(3581397, 501866, 40819, '<td valign="top">The statue is just a little to far to the right for my taste but it is an exquisite image.</td>', 'The statue is just a little to far to the right for my taste but it is an exquisite image.', '2007-04-25 12:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581401, 500773, 31829, '<td valign="top">Seems like a centered composition rather than thirds.</td>', 'Seems like a centered composition rather than thirds.', '2007-04-25 12:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581433, 502454, 31829, '<td valign="top">This is cenetered...</td>', 'This is cenetered...', '2007-04-25 12:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581439, 499487, 40819, '<td valign="top">I don''t think so. Though you graphicly produced an image which clearly shows what the rule is all about, the subject if the images is the whole and not an item along the lines.<br/> <br/>Well really it is your idea but I think it falls short of even a mention. What would have made it wonderful is if the wall was clean and shinny.</td>', 'I don''t think so. Though you graphicly produced an image which clearly shows what the rule is all about, the subject if the images is the whole and not an item along the lines. Well really it is your idea but I think it falls short of even a mention. What would have made it wonderful is if the wall was clean and shinny.', '2007-04-25 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581492, 502202, 5112, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, so many hats :)  It looks pixelated (I think that''s the word), sort of like it was made with a long lens and cropped down?  It actually works for this image.  Good job!</td>', 'Interesting shot, so many hats :)  It looks pixelated (I think that''s the word), sort of like it was made with a long lens and cropped down?  It actually works for this image.  Good job!', '2007-04-25 12:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581502, 500988, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!  So colourful, and yet it almost looks monochromatic.</td>', 'Beautiful image!  So colourful, and yet it almost looks monochromatic.', '2007-04-25 12:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581521, 500161, 5112, '<td valign="top">You captured the expression well - very "pensive".</td>', 'You captured the expression well - very "pensive".', '2007-04-25 12:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3581607, 502573, 54033, '<td valign="top">Why so rude! Is it a southern seagull? The photo does not say much if anything at all.</td>', 'Why so rude! Is it a southern seagull? The photo does not say much if anything at all.', '2007-04-25 13:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
