(3581998, 501026, 71931, '<td valign="top">An outstanding photo!  Exquisite focus.  B&amp;W was definitely a wise choice.  The expression on the cat is marvelous; being in middle-age myself, I can certainly see myself (at times) mirrored here.  My only reason for not giving this a ten (and it''s a bit churlish of me, but this *is* about the Rule of Thirds, after all) is that I think this should have been cropped to move the cat to the right just a tiny amount: a little too much brick is showing.  The eyes are a little off the grid nodes, which is really a petty complaint, but there it is.  Still and all, this is a wonderful photo :-)</td>', 'An outstanding photo!  Exquisite focus.  B&W was definitely a wise choice.  The expression on the cat is marvelous; being in middle-age myself, I can certainly see myself (at times) mirrored here.  My only reason for not giving this a ten (and it''s a bit churlish of me, but this *is* about the Rule of Thirds, after all) is that I think this should have been cropped to move the cat to the right just a tiny amount: a little too much brick is showing.  The eyes are a little off the grid nodes, which is really a petty complaint, but there it is.  Still and all, this is a wonderful photo :-)', '2007-04-25 14:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582002, 500773, 76198, '<td valign="top">Rule of thirds?</td>', 'Rule of thirds?', '2007-04-25 14:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582005, 501473, 71931, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast, both in colors and shapes.  Good use of the Rule.</td>', 'Very nice contrast, both in colors and shapes.  Good use of the Rule.', '2007-04-25 14:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
