(3582110, 501036, 71931, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide what I think about this shot.  Part of me wants to reject it as trivial, but part of me sees something a lot more sublime than my first glance says is there.  I might be back to change my vote, but if it stays at a ''6'', you''ll know why; I can''t make up my mind.  If nothing else, you''re challenging me to really look at this photo, which is what all good photographers should do :-)</td>', 'I can''t decide what I think about this shot.  Part of me wants to reject it as trivial, but part of me sees something a lot more sublime than my first glance says is there.  I might be back to change my vote, but if it stays at a ''6'', you''ll know why; I can''t make up my mind.  If nothing else, you''re challenging me to really look at this photo, which is what all good photographers should do :-)', '2007-04-25 15:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582113, 501916, 63812, '<td valign="top">nice shot. perfect</td>', 'nice shot. perfect', '2007-04-25 15:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582125, 501070, 63812, '<td valign="top">really beautiful</td>', 'really beautiful', '2007-04-25 15:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582135, 501763, 71931, '<td valign="top">Excellent in just about every way.  Love the color contrast :-)</td>', 'Excellent in just about every way.  Love the color contrast :-)', '2007-04-25 15:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582142, 501841, 71931, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrasts.</td>', 'Nice color contrasts.', '2007-04-25 15:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582152, 502375, 71931, '<td valign="top">This works very well.  You break the rules about flow and not having images looking out of the frame, and all that, but it still works.  Nicely done :-)</td>', 'This works very well.  You break the rules about flow and not having images looking out of the frame, and all that, but it still works.  Nicely done :-)', '2007-04-25 15:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582170, 501840, 71931, '<td valign="top">Excellent action shot!  Good focus, you caught all the primary players looking inward... The folks at SI couldn''t have done much better with all their high-priced equipment.</td>', 'Excellent action shot!  Good focus, you caught all the primary players looking inward... The folks at SI couldn''t have done much better with all their high-priced equipment.', '2007-04-25 15:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582172, 501789, 63812, '<td valign="top">basic editing?</td>', 'basic editing?', '2007-04-25 15:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582174, 502642, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool moment to freeze but I always want to see faces/expressions when viewing action shots that have humans in them, not to have to guess what their expressions are and that is what "only" makes this above average instead of exceptional.  6 from me.</td>', 'Pretty cool moment to freeze but I always want to see faces/expressions when viewing action shots that have humans in them, not to have to guess what their expressions are and that is what "only" makes this above average instead of exceptional.  6 from me.', '2007-04-25 15:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582185, 501621, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too grainy for my taste and I do have a taste for it, just doesn´t seem to suit this image IMHO.  5 from me.</td>', 'A bit too grainy for my taste and I do have a taste for it, just doesn´t seem to suit this image IMHO.  5 from me.', '2007-04-25 15:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582201, 499850, 21362, '<td valign="top">LOL, "say cheese." <br/> <br/>Beautiful shot.</td>', 'LOL, "say cheese."  Beautiful shot.', '2007-04-25 15:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582203, 501309, 66384, '<td valign="top">I do not think this meets the challenge. The subject is dead center rather than on one of the intersecting "power points".</td>', 'I do not think this meets the challenge. The subject is dead center rather than on one of the intersecting "power points".', '2007-04-25 15:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582204, 502097, 27482, '<td valign="top">I got absolutely nothing against high key shots but personally I want to see some very light texture instead of blown highlights.</td>', 'I got absolutely nothing against high key shots but personally I want to see some very light texture instead of blown highlights.', '2007-04-25 15:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582205, 501832, 71931, '<td valign="top">Breaking the Rule by following the Rule by bending the Rule...  Nice shot, but...</td>', 'Breaking the Rule by following the Rule by bending the Rule...  Nice shot, but...', '2007-04-25 15:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582210, 502180, 71931, '<td valign="top">ROFL!</td>', 'ROFL!', '2007-04-25 15:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582213, 500517, 27482, '<td valign="top">For my taste the image could stand to be a bit brighter/more contrasty but nice play with bokeh and DOF.</td>', 'For my taste the image could stand to be a bit brighter/more contrasty but nice play with bokeh and DOF.', '2007-04-25 15:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582216, 502180, 27482, '<td valign="top">I saw so many great shots from this fire this week that this just doesn´t compare and I can´t help but compare it to those.  Not bad though so it got a 5 from me.</td>', 'I saw so many great shots from this fire this week that this just doesn´t compare and I can´t help but compare it to those.  Not bad though so it got a 5 from me.', '2007-04-25 15:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582218, 501596, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and contrast between curves and straight lines but I think this could be lighter</td>', 'I love the composition and contrast between curves and straight lines but I think this could be lighter', '2007-04-25 15:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582219, 501875, 74804, '<td valign="top">just a little more contrast, and just a tad bit lighter would have been great, but its an awesome picture</td>', 'just a little more contrast, and just a tad bit lighter would have been great, but its an awesome picture', '2007-04-25 15:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582223, 500138, 49652, '<td valign="top">Terrific perspective.  The black and white is great.</td>', 'Terrific perspective.  The black and white is great.', '2007-04-25 15:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582224, 501799, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but don´t really see this as a great moment in time to capture, seems more like a shot taken between shots as you have good lighting and DOF here.  Was there no shot where she proudly stood and admired what´s around her or posed for the camera?</td>', 'Not bad but don´t really see this as a great moment in time to capture, seems more like a shot taken between shots as you have good lighting and DOF here.  Was there no shot where she proudly stood and admired what´s around her or posed for the camera?', '2007-04-25 15:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582226, 502326, 49652, '<td valign="top">Well seen!  I love how the reflection is all askew.</td>', 'Well seen!  I love how the reflection is all askew.', '2007-04-25 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582228, 501017, 27482, '<td valign="top">Seen a LOT of flower shots but they are still nice when they are done as well as this one, perfectly exposed and great colors, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Seen a LOT of flower shots but they are still nice when they are done as well as this one, perfectly exposed and great colors, gave it a 7.', '2007-04-25 15:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582230, 501253, 49652, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!</td>', 'Very interesting!', '2007-04-25 15:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
