(3582236, 501178, 27482, '<td valign="top">When you enter a shot here you need to ask yourself, is this an interesting enough photograph to grab the voters?</td>', 'When you enter a shot here you need to ask yourself, is this an interesting enough photograph to grab the voters?', '2007-04-25 15:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582237, 501906, 49652, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous!</td>', 'This is fabulous!', '2007-04-25 15:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582241, 502554, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Sorry but having those lines in the shot is just too corny, why on earth did you go through the trouble of including them :)</td>', 'Lol!  Sorry but having those lines in the shot is just too corny, why on earth did you go through the trouble of including them :)', '2007-04-25 15:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582245, 502566, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, although I do not think it is a good example of Rule of Thirds. The eyes and backs look like they are on horizontal third lines, but there is nothing of importance on the intersecting "power points". If the crop was wider, the eyes or teeth would be on the power points. Too bad about the timing, this probably would win in the Symmetry challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful image, although I do not think it is a good example of Rule of Thirds. The eyes and backs look like they are on horizontal third lines, but there is nothing of importance on the intersecting "power points". If the crop was wider, the eyes or teeth would be on the power points. Too bad about the timing, this probably would win in the Symmetry challenge.', '2007-04-25 15:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582246, 502205, 49652, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2007-04-25 15:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3582249, 501271, 49652, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Well done!  Looks cold.</td>', 'Ha!  Well done!  Looks cold.', '2007-04-25 15:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
