(3582259, 501473, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract design, love the textures, light, and colors. And an excellent example of the rule. Putting it in my favorites.</td>', 'Very nice abstract design, love the textures, light, and colors. And an excellent example of the rule. Putting it in my favorites.', '2007-04-25 15:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
