(3582294, 501777, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and processing -- very artistic, but not using the rule of thirds effectively, IMO. The guitarist appears to be in the left third, and the amp in the lower left ninth, but nothing of significance is at the intersecting power points.</td>', 'Interesting shot and processing -- very artistic, but not using the rule of thirds effectively, IMO. The guitarist appears to be in the left third, and the amp in the lower left ninth, but nothing of significance is at the intersecting power points.', '2007-04-25 15:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
