(3582299, 502448, 66353, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Perfect focus, excellent composition and taken at the exact right split second. Must be worth a 9...</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Perfect focus, excellent composition and taken at the exact right split second. Must be worth a 9...', '2007-04-25 15:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
