(3583284, 499487, 77196, '<td valign="top">Sorry. grunge on the grout does not a good picture make. I like the gutsiness of doing a straight rule of thirds. To make this picture work, the grout would have to be clean (gleaming white clean), and the tile would have to pop (not necessarily with color - I kind-of like the grey).</td>', 'Sorry. grunge on the grout does not a good picture make. I like the gutsiness of doing a straight rule of thirds. To make this picture work, the grout would have to be clean (gleaming white clean), and the tile would have to pop (not necessarily with color - I kind-of like the grey).', '2007-04-25 21:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
