(3583490, 501178, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and nice angle. This could benefit from a good zoom. Current framing includes the lower left corner of brown, the sky almost uniform white, and a yellow building in the upper right, leaving the beautiful flowers about 25-35% of the picture. Try cropping it so the partially leafed tree is at the upper left foci, and the willow as the upper right foci and see what you think. Also watch your shadow - is that it in the center lower edge of the picture or just dark green grass?</td>', 'Wonderful color and nice angle. This could benefit from a good zoom. Current framing includes the lower left corner of brown, the sky almost uniform white, and a yellow building in the upper right, leaving the beautiful flowers about 25-35% of the picture. Try cropping it so the partially leafed tree is at the upper left foci, and the willow as the upper right foci and see what you think. Also watch your shadow - is that it in the center lower edge of the picture or just dark green grass?', '2007-04-25 22:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3583499, 501453, 68309, '<td valign="top">very well done</td>', 'very well done', '2007-04-25 22:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
