(3585712, 500718, 76184, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this photo, not sure why.<br/> <br/>Perhaps it was my lack of understanding of it. I still don''t feel that I will raise my vote much higher, but it does draw me back for consideration. I suppose that on its own makes this photo worthy of a higher vote than my initial "2"<br/> <br/>I''m still struggling with the lighting. I''m turned off by the blown out railing on the right side, and I am not a fan of the sunlight in the upper right corner. I do appreciate the simplicity of the whole thing, and the vertical lines of the fencing and the diagonals of the shadows and how they relate to one another. I get no message from the piece, but it is good in and of itself, but not grand.<br/> <br/>I''ll raise my vote to a 5.</td>', 'I had to come back to this photo, not sure why. Perhaps it was my lack of understanding of it. I still don''t feel that I will raise my vote much higher, but it does draw me back for consideration. I suppose that on its own makes this photo worthy of a higher vote than my initial "2" I''m still struggling with the lighting. I''m turned off by the blown out railing on the right side, and I am not a fan of the sunlight in the upper right corner. I do appreciate the simplicity of the whole thing, and the vertical lines of the fencing and the diagonals of the shadows and how they relate to one another. I get no message from the piece, but it is good in and of itself, but not grand. I''ll raise my vote to a 5.', '2007-04-26 16:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
