(3588984, 502395, 77250, '<td valign="top">This is truly an outstanding image.  Great scene with a lot of interest, yet presented in a way that is very minimalistic.  Great use of the rule of thirds as well.</td>', 'This is truly an outstanding image.  Great scene with a lot of interest, yet presented in a way that is very minimalistic.  Great use of the rule of thirds as well.', '2007-04-27 18:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588986, 500497, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple photograph.  Great "black" and "white".</td>', 'Nice and simple photograph.  Great "black" and "white".', '2007-04-27 18:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588987, 501164, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you chose to do this shot in monochrome.  It doesn''t seem to add anything to the picture.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you chose to do this shot in monochrome.  It doesn''t seem to add anything to the picture.', '2007-04-27 18:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588989, 502649, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  The rule of thirds was used well here.  there is a lot of interest throughout the image.  Great job.</td>', 'Nice photograph.  The rule of thirds was used well here.  there is a lot of interest throughout the image.  Great job.', '2007-04-27 18:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588993, 500326, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  The only thing I can say is that it does look just a little crooked.  If the image was tilted slightly to the left then it would earn a 10 from me.</td>', 'Nice photograph.  The only thing I can say is that it does look just a little crooked.  If the image was tilted slightly to the left then it would earn a 10 from me.', '2007-04-27 18:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588995, 499487, 77250, '<td valign="top">I''ve got to hand it to you.  You''ve presented a photograph that has a lot of interest while defining the rule of thrids.  Perfect 10.</td>', 'I''ve got to hand it to you.  You''ve presented a photograph that has a lot of interest while defining the rule of thrids.  Perfect 10.', '2007-04-27 18:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588996, 502062, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  Great use of the rule of thirds and great image of a nice scene.  You should try a multi-tone for your own benefit.  Maybe a magenta (dark) and a cyan (light) would look nice with this image.</td>', 'Nice photograph.  Great use of the rule of thirds and great image of a nice scene.  You should try a multi-tone for your own benefit.  Maybe a magenta (dark) and a cyan (light) would look nice with this image.', '2007-04-27 18:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3588999, 502368, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  I love the very juxtaposed composition.  Nicely done and great use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Nice photograph.  I love the very juxtaposed composition.  Nicely done and great use of the rule of thirds.', '2007-04-27 18:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589000, 499818, 77250, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  Good use of the rule of thrids and nice tones and colors (or lack thereof).  I really enjoy the white wings on the birds and the "GRATER" on the building.  There is a lot of interest in such a small amount of subject matter here.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice photograph.  Good use of the rule of thrids and nice tones and colors (or lack thereof).  I really enjoy the white wings on the birds and the "GRATER" on the building.  There is a lot of interest in such a small amount of subject matter here.  Well done.', '2007-04-27 18:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589014, 502660, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What an amazing shot.  The lighting is perfect, as is the shutter speed.  The black background really makes the (nicely saturated) colors stand out, the focus is dead on, it''s well composed and fits the theme.  Outstanding shot and the first one I''ve ever given above an 8.  Nice work!</td>', 'Wow.  What an amazing shot.  The lighting is perfect, as is the shutter speed.  The black background really makes the (nicely saturated) colors stand out, the focus is dead on, it''s well composed and fits the theme.  Outstanding shot and the first one I''ve ever given above an 8.  Nice work!', '2007-04-27 19:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589016, 502378, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot but I''d really love to see more color saturation.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot but I''d really love to see more color saturation.', '2007-04-27 19:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589048, 502693, 51269, '<td valign="top">this looks like an old painting- very beautiful &amp; moody-10</td>', 'this looks like an old painting- very beautiful & moody-10', '2007-04-27 19:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589049, 502022, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot except that the background light is so bright that it just wipes everything else out.  It took me several seconds to even figure out what I was looking at.  I would LOVE to see this shot again but with a dimmer backlight to reduce the glare.</td>', 'This is a nice shot except that the background light is so bright that it just wipes everything else out.  It took me several seconds to even figure out what I was looking at.  I would LOVE to see this shot again but with a dimmer backlight to reduce the glare.', '2007-04-27 19:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589060, 500496, 51269, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective but very out of focus...</td>', 'interesting perspective but very out of focus...', '2007-04-27 19:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589103, 501507, 32644, '<td valign="top">Cool macro!</td>', 'Cool macro!', '2007-04-27 20:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589113, 502691, 32644, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the halo around the tree and I don''t know how it got there in basic editing. The overall shot needs to be more in focus. Better luck next time.</td>', 'I don''t care for the halo around the tree and I don''t know how it got there in basic editing. The overall shot needs to be more in focus. Better luck next time.', '2007-04-27 20:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589140, 502443, 52130, '<td valign="top">the frame looks jagged. probably from rotation. otherwise nice</td>', 'the frame looks jagged. probably from rotation. otherwise nice', '2007-04-27 20:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589142, 501119, 52130, '<td valign="top">very pretty, but I''m not seeing an apparent rule of thirds here. do you mean the focus? I''ll assume so for voting sake.</td>', 'very pretty, but I''m not seeing an apparent rule of thirds here. do you mean the focus? I''ll assume so for voting sake.', '2007-04-27 20:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589155, 502629, 73414, '<td valign="top">He''s adorable!</td>', 'He''s adorable!', '2007-04-27 20:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589160, 502022, 73414, '<td valign="top">Favorite! Instantly!</td>', 'Favorite! Instantly!', '2007-04-27 20:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589186, 502443, 57726, '<td valign="top">Really, really great job here.  I''ve seen this effect once or twice before, but was so inspired by your photo I cut out a mat and got my daughter to try it.  Your use of an additional white frame around the photo really enhances the effect.  Great lighting and color as well.  9.</td>', 'Really, really great job here.  I''ve seen this effect once or twice before, but was so inspired by your photo I cut out a mat and got my daughter to try it.  Your use of an additional white frame around the photo really enhances the effect.  Great lighting and color as well.  9.', '2007-04-27 21:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589187, 500392, 57726, '<td valign="top">All the elements of a great photo.  Lighting, colors, sharp detail, contrast.  Well done.  9.</td>', 'All the elements of a great photo.  Lighting, colors, sharp detail, contrast.  Well done.  9.', '2007-04-27 21:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589188, 502566, 63822, '<td valign="top">Great Capture!!</td>', 'Great Capture!!', '2007-04-27 21:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589190, 502231, 57726, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and detail on this.  Also well lit and composed.  8.</td>', 'Great sharpness and detail on this.  Also well lit and composed.  8.', '2007-04-27 21:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589210, 502693, 70265, '<td valign="top">I love the fairy tale quality to this photo. The square comp &amp; B&amp;W work well too. 8</td>', 'I love the fairy tale quality to this photo. The square comp & B&W work well too. 8', '2007-04-27 21:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3589282, 502428, 67152, '<td valign="top">the composition is really nice but the sky is quite noisy and grainy as if the image was oversharpened</td>', 'the composition is really nice but the sky is quite noisy and grainy as if the image was oversharpened', '2007-04-27 21:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
