(3589298, 500323, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the falls in the upper left - but the colors seem a bit off - quite yellowish - as if the white balance was set incorrectly.</td>', 'I like the placement of the falls in the upper left - but the colors seem a bit off - quite yellowish - as if the white balance was set incorrectly.', '2007-04-27 22:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
