(3589423, 502393, 42013, '<td valign="top">Kind of dark. It would be nice to have a touch more focus on the person, since that appears to be your subject.</td>', 'Kind of dark. It would be nice to have a touch more focus on the person, since that appears to be your subject.', '2007-04-27 23:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
