(3589429, 501764, 42013, '<td valign="top">Contrast might be a little heavy, notice the strange colors of the red on the pheasants head.</td>', 'Contrast might be a little heavy, notice the strange colors of the red on the pheasants head.', '2007-04-27 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
