(3592254, 501813, 51802, '<td valign="top">The bird is only slightly off center.  I don''t feel this meets the challenge.</td>', 'The bird is only slightly off center.  I don''t feel this meets the challenge.', '2007-04-29 12:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
