(3592445, 501865, 57229, '<td valign="top">The one thing that''s definitely on one of the ''third crosshairs'' is the man. It also seems that he is irrelevant to the picture as a whole. The way he echoes the sky though, and all the dynamic lines and the colours make for such a great picture that I have to give it at least 7 anyway. :)</td>', 'The one thing that''s definitely on one of the ''third crosshairs'' is the man. It also seems that he is irrelevant to the picture as a whole. The way he echoes the sky though, and all the dynamic lines and the colours make for such a great picture that I have to give it at least 7 anyway. :)', '2007-04-29 15:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3592469, 501816, 34031, '<td valign="top">Nice, high contrast, but I really struggle with the selective colour. Is the jacket the subject of the photo or the person?</td>', 'Nice, high contrast, but I really struggle with the selective colour. Is the jacket the subject of the photo or the person?', '2007-04-29 15:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
