(3593330, 502443, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too grainy for my taste, I sometimes like grain in shots but mostly in b/w shots or low saturation ones.</td>', 'A bit too grainy for my taste, I sometimes like grain in shots but mostly in b/w shots or low saturation ones.', '2007-04-29 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593336, 502432, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is certainly Icelandic :)  A bit too bright for my taste, had you exposed this half or a third of a stop less, you would have gotten stronger colors and some more detail in the white areas of this shot, try it next time, I´ll bet you´ll agree.</td>', 'This is certainly Icelandic :)  A bit too bright for my taste, had you exposed this half or a third of a stop less, you would have gotten stronger colors and some more detail in the white areas of this shot, try it next time, I´ll bet you´ll agree.', '2007-04-29 22:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593338, 502398, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, I like the silhouette and feel to this image, 7 from me.</td>', 'Pretty good, I like the silhouette and feel to this image, 7 from me.', '2007-04-29 22:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593345, 501832, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not going to hassle you with the standard rule of thirds, there is so much more to that "rule" than just the intersection points that people are so obsessed with.  However, this is shot hardly made me think of the rule but instead that you kindof shoehorned this into the challenge but not moving any points around because of it.  This shot is technically very well done and got a 7 from me, needs some extra "pow" for me to give a higher rating than that, like some action going on.</td>', 'Well not going to hassle you with the standard rule of thirds, there is so much more to that "rule" than just the intersection points that people are so obsessed with.  However, this is shot hardly made me think of the rule but instead that you kindof shoehorned this into the challenge but not moving any points around because of it.  This shot is technically very well done and got a 7 from me, needs some extra "pow" for me to give a higher rating than that, like some action going on.', '2007-04-29 22:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593355, 502459, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but shots against the sune with intense flare have long since stopped to impress me, this did however when I started out taking pictures but you need to do something more these days to impress me, when I look at this photograph I immediately think "snapshot".</td>', 'Sorry but shots against the sune with intense flare have long since stopped to impress me, this did however when I started out taking pictures but you need to do something more these days to impress me, when I look at this photograph I immediately think "snapshot".', '2007-04-29 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593357, 502693, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for my taste, you sure your monitor is calibrated?</td>', 'A bit too dark for my taste, you sure your monitor is calibrated?', '2007-04-29 22:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593361, 502660, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, the "rain" is actually quite believable and one of the better flower shots I have seen here in a while, got an 8 from me, well done.</td>', 'Not bad, the "rain" is actually quite believable and one of the better flower shots I have seen here in a while, got an 8 from me, well done.', '2007-04-29 22:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
