(3593371, 499796, 27482, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have gone closer and used a wider focal length as that yellow fence isn´t really doing anything to help this photo in my opinion other than to draw attention to itself.</td>', 'Personally I would have gone closer and used a wider focal length as that yellow fence isn´t really doing anything to help this photo in my opinion other than to draw attention to itself.', '2007-04-29 22:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
