(3593392, 501309, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well the "rule" is to take care when shooting against the sun to either have it dark enough to make it seem intentional and have a silhouette or use some sort of fill lighting.  It´s great to break these rules of course but with this shot I feel it would have come out better if you had taken it at a time of day the sun was at least to your side but preferrably behind you.</td>', 'Well the "rule" is to take care when shooting against the sun to either have it dark enough to make it seem intentional and have a silhouette or use some sort of fill lighting.  It´s great to break these rules of course but with this shot I feel it would have come out better if you had taken it at a time of day the sun was at least to your side but preferrably behind you.', '2007-04-29 23:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593393, 502527, 27482, '<td valign="top">Is the guy to the left taking a leak?  :P</td>', 'Is the guy to the left taking a leak?  :P', '2007-04-29 23:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
