(3593395, 501400, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well techically a bit too close to the edge for the rule of thirds but not nearly enough off that I am going to dock points for that, this is a lovely shot and got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Well techically a bit too close to the edge for the rule of thirds but not nearly enough off that I am going to dock points for that, this is a lovely shot and got a 6 from me.', '2007-04-29 23:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593398, 502449, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot is pretty impressive, I still think I would have liked it better with something else in the frame than just the window and the wall, like some firefighter reaching for that window or whatever but this works well and has great tones in it, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'This shot is pretty impressive, I still think I would have liked it better with something else in the frame than just the window and the wall, like some firefighter reaching for that window or whatever but this works well and has great tones in it, got a 7 from me.', '2007-04-29 23:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593401, 502657, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but a bit flat contrast wise for my taste, also lighting could be a bit better as the right hand blends in too much with the backround, would have been great to have some rim light on that hand just as you have on the left hand.</td>', 'Not bad but a bit flat contrast wise for my taste, also lighting could be a bit better as the right hand blends in too much with the backround, would have been great to have some rim light on that hand just as you have on the left hand.', '2007-04-29 23:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593406, 502247, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, sky maybe a bit to dull for my taste though, I know you can´t in basic editing but for yourself, did you try to add some gradient to it in a fashion so it darkens towards the top?</td>', 'Not bad, sky maybe a bit to dull for my taste though, I know you can´t in basic editing but for yourself, did you try to add some gradient to it in a fashion so it darkens towards the top?', '2007-04-29 23:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593408, 501974, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very nice, perfect DOF, any more and this shot would have been WAY too busy for my taste, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Very nice, perfect DOF, any more and this shot would have been WAY too busy for my taste, gave it a 7.', '2007-04-29 23:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593411, 501989, 27482, '<td valign="top">Somehow the title throws me a bit off, seems a little disrespectful but this shot is pretty good.  I like it in color but have a strong feeling I would like it even better in b/w with perhaps even stronger contrast, did you try that?</td>', 'Somehow the title throws me a bit off, seems a little disrespectful but this shot is pretty good.  I like it in color but have a strong feeling I would like it even better in b/w with perhaps even stronger contrast, did you try that?', '2007-04-29 23:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593418, 500653, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but I feel the focus could be a bit stronger on the couple, as well as the light falling on them isn´t making them very distinct against that backround, did you try very faint fill lighting from the side on them?</td>', 'Not bad but I feel the focus could be a bit stronger on the couple, as well as the light falling on them isn´t making them very distinct against that backround, did you try very faint fill lighting from the side on them?', '2007-04-29 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593425, 502070, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good, I like the tones and contrast/sharpness.  Sky looks a bit odd though, did you brighten the middle part of it?</td>', 'This is pretty good, I like the tones and contrast/sharpness.  Sky looks a bit odd though, did you brighten the middle part of it?', '2007-04-29 23:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
