(3593430, 501503, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but colors are a bit too strong for my taste, I didn´t check the histogram but both the green and especially the blue channel look blown to me.</td>', 'Not bad but colors are a bit too strong for my taste, I didn´t check the histogram but both the green and especially the blue channel look blown to me.', '2007-04-29 23:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593431, 501507, 27482, '<td valign="top">I wish that blurry top part wasn´t included, it just draws too much attention IMHO, rest of the shot is very good, good DOF and clarity.</td>', 'I wish that blurry top part wasn´t included, it just draws too much attention IMHO, rest of the shot is very good, good DOF and clarity.', '2007-04-29 23:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593436, 501720, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but what this shot needs IMHO is a main subject, my eyes just wander around the frame and stop nowhere.</td>', 'Not bad but what this shot needs IMHO is a main subject, my eyes just wander around the frame and stop nowhere.', '2007-04-29 23:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593437, 501597, 27482, '<td valign="top">Just in case you didn´t check your histogram, the bottom left corner highlights are blown to bits and also that persons nose but I don´t really find it distracting, the composition works well to draw my eye first to the dog and then the person.  6 from me.</td>', 'Just in case you didn´t check your histogram, the bottom left corner highlights are blown to bits and also that persons nose but I don´t really find it distracting, the composition works well to draw my eye first to the dog and then the person.  6 from me.', '2007-04-29 23:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593440, 501164, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have never taken photos of a propeller plane but there is a certain shutterspeed wich you have to stay under so you don´t freeze the propeller like that, photos of propeller planes always look so much better when they are moving, you might want to keep that in mind next time.</td>', 'I have never taken photos of a propeller plane but there is a certain shutterspeed wich you have to stay under so you don´t freeze the propeller like that, photos of propeller planes always look so much better when they are moving, you might want to keep that in mind next time.', '2007-04-29 23:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593448, 501055, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, a bit too saturated for my personal taste, or perhaps white balance too warm, other than that pretty good interior shot, not great though as it doesn´t really give me the sense of the space, perhaps wider lens next time?</td>', 'Nice, a bit too saturated for my personal taste, or perhaps white balance too warm, other than that pretty good interior shot, not great though as it doesn´t really give me the sense of the space, perhaps wider lens next time?', '2007-04-29 23:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593451, 502067, 27482, '<td valign="top">Title is good, well perhaps freedom a bit too strong a word but it looks lovely where he is heading for sure.</td>', 'Title is good, well perhaps freedom a bit too strong a word but it looks lovely where he is heading for sure.', '2007-04-29 23:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593453, 501680, 27482, '<td valign="top">Personally for my taste the white balance is a bit too cool and the image a bit too flat contrast wise but other than that good.</td>', 'Personally for my taste the white balance is a bit too cool and the image a bit too flat contrast wise but other than that good.', '2007-04-29 23:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593541, 502015, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but the fact that part of the sky is pink and not yellow like the rest of the scene made me vote a point lower, it just seems to upset the balance to this photo.  Still gave a 6 as it´s very nice.</td>', 'Not bad but the fact that part of the sky is pink and not yellow like the rest of the scene made me vote a point lower, it just seems to upset the balance to this photo.  Still gave a 6 as it´s very nice.', '2007-04-30 00:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3593549, 502609, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice shot, maybe tilting the camera upwards so you had a bit less foreground and more sky would have been better, I at least get that feeling from viewing this photo but a pretty good shot, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Pretty nice shot, maybe tilting the camera upwards so you had a bit less foreground and more sky would have been better, I at least get that feeling from viewing this photo but a pretty good shot, got a 7 from me.', '2007-04-30 00:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
