(3593562, 502249, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great b/w tones and contrast.  However, that Porche in the backround is a bit distracting, the fact that I, not even close to being a car nerd can make out the model means it´s too distracting, I know that you would probably have lost that moment had you moved to the right a bit but that is still my suggestion to improve this photo.  Love the rest of it and gave a 7.</td>', 'Nice shot, great b/w tones and contrast.  However, that Porche in the backround is a bit distracting, the fact that I, not even close to being a car nerd can make out the model means it´s too distracting, I know that you would probably have lost that moment had you moved to the right a bit but that is still my suggestion to improve this photo.  Love the rest of it and gave a 7.', '2007-04-30 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
