(3593691, 502368, 27482, '<td valign="top">Now I like this shot, just tiny bit bothers me that twig that is just barely squeezing itself into the frame, couldn´t you have cropped 0.1% of the right side?  Other than that, love this shot, gave it a 7.  Tried it in b/w with more contrast?</td>', 'Now I like this shot, just tiny bit bothers me that twig that is just barely squeezing itself into the frame, couldn´t you have cropped 0.1% of the right side?  Other than that, love this shot, gave it a 7.  Tried it in b/w with more contrast?', '2007-04-30 00:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
