(3593697, 501576, 27482, '<td valign="top">Personally this shot would appeal more to me with a warmer white balance, also with some softer lighting.</td>', 'Personally this shot would appeal more to me with a warmer white balance, also with some softer lighting.', '2007-04-30 00:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
