(3593701, 502184, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, normally I am excited about slanted compositions but this case, it just makes the image a bit too busy and gives me a slight sense of vertigo, not a good thing, but I encourage you to keep at it, to try and find unusual angles.</td>', 'Sorry, normally I am excited about slanted compositions but this case, it just makes the image a bit too busy and gives me a slight sense of vertigo, not a good thing, but I encourage you to keep at it, to try and find unusual angles.', '2007-04-30 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594049, 500770, 63244, '<td valign="top">I really don''t care for the huge white border. The photograph is nice on it''s own without the white. Your border is a warm white and the photograph appears to have a much cooler tone.  The two are fighting IMO. :) The little girl on the left appears to be more centered than at a third point. The other two are pretty close.  It feels like you could have cropped some of the left off (part of the tree thingy) to move the subjects over to the left a bit.  The contrast and lighting are nice. Subject matter is interesting.</td>', 'I really don''t care for the huge white border. The photograph is nice on it''s own without the white. Your border is a warm white and the photograph appears to have a much cooler tone.  The two are fighting IMO. :) The little girl on the left appears to be more centered than at a third point. The other two are pretty close.  It feels like you could have cropped some of the left off (part of the tree thingy) to move the subjects over to the left a bit.  The contrast and lighting are nice. Subject matter is interesting.', '2007-04-30 01:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594057, 499818, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like the grungy feel here.  Very sharp photo and nice colors. The birds look almost artificial.</td>', 'I like the grungy feel here.  Very sharp photo and nice colors. The birds look almost artificial.', '2007-04-30 01:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594075, 500630, 63244, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is one of my favorite places.  Might have been able to use a ND or polarizing filter to keep the different lighting situations more even. Perhaps crop this a bit tighter so the waterfall is a bit more pronounced in the photo.</td>', 'Oh, this is one of my favorite places.  Might have been able to use a ND or polarizing filter to keep the different lighting situations more even. Perhaps crop this a bit tighter so the waterfall is a bit more pronounced in the photo.', '2007-04-30 01:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594088, 502534, 63244, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The backlight is very good and yet, you still have good lighting on the face. Great bokeh as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great portrait. The backlight is very good and yet, you still have good lighting on the face. Great bokeh as well. Nicely done.', '2007-04-30 01:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
