(3594807, 502478, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell 100% with this shot in web resolution but it seems to me that the head of the ladybug is not in focus but the focus is slightly behind the head, regardless I would want to see better clarity for me to score higher than 6.  Love the butter smooth backround.</td>', 'Hard to tell 100% with this shot in web resolution but it seems to me that the head of the ladybug is not in focus but the focus is slightly behind the head, regardless I would want to see better clarity for me to score higher than 6.  Love the butter smooth backround.', '2007-04-30 07:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594808, 500770, 74588, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2007-04-30 07:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594810, 502094, 27482, '<td valign="top">Yaysus!  Did you get any shots of him falling, now THAT would be interesting, but maybe just cause I am a vicious SOB :)</td>', 'Yaysus!  Did you get any shots of him falling, now THAT would be interesting, but maybe just cause I am a vicious SOB :)', '2007-04-30 07:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594818, 501575, 74588, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2007-04-30 07:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594819, 501711, 74588, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2007-04-30 07:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594820, 501863, 27482, '<td valign="top">The right part of the photo is lovely, wish the left part were as nice, the strong heavy shadow area isn´t very interesting and frankly takes the attention away from the canal.</td>', 'The right part of the photo is lovely, wish the left part were as nice, the strong heavy shadow area isn´t very interesting and frankly takes the attention away from the canal.', '2007-04-30 07:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594824, 502170, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, what a gang :)</td>', 'Haha, what a gang :)', '2007-04-30 07:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594826, 501865, 27482, '<td valign="top">I kindof like this, nice perspective.</td>', 'I kindof like this, nice perspective.', '2007-04-30 07:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594829, 501575, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, wish you had taken it another time of day though as the shadows and foreground are so dark, did you try taking this around sunrise/sunset for softer lighting?  Spot looks nice, is this in the Alps?</td>', 'Nice shot, wish you had taken it another time of day though as the shadows and foreground are so dark, did you try taking this around sunrise/sunset for softer lighting?  Spot looks nice, is this in the Alps?', '2007-04-30 07:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594832, 502638, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too grainy for my taste but I know you have to bump up the ISO when you are diving so can´t really fault you for that.  I sometimes take down the saturation and up the contrast when shooting at high iso to hide the noise, did you try it?</td>', 'A bit too grainy for my taste but I know you have to bump up the ISO when you are diving so can´t really fault you for that.  I sometimes take down the saturation and up the contrast when shooting at high iso to hide the noise, did you try it?', '2007-04-30 07:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594833, 502348, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but some fill lighting would have done wonders for this shot.</td>', 'Not bad but some fill lighting would have done wonders for this shot.', '2007-04-30 07:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594836, 501809, 27482, '<td valign="top">Somehow I think this shot would have had a bigger impact on me had her pose/stance either been a bit more agressive or "zen", it´s somewhere in between and doesn´t seem to me to be very well thought out.  Also having her directly under the tree is maybe not the best choice, had you taken a couple of steps to either side and had her in a lower corner and the tree in the opposite upper corner I think the composition would have been much more balanced.  Good shot anyway and above average in the challenge, gave a 6.</td>', 'Somehow I think this shot would have had a bigger impact on me had her pose/stance either been a bit more agressive or "zen", it´s somewhere in between and doesn´t seem to me to be very well thought out.  Also having her directly under the tree is maybe not the best choice, had you taken a couple of steps to either side and had her in a lower corner and the tree in the opposite upper corner I think the composition would have been much more balanced.  Good shot anyway and above average in the challenge, gave a 6.', '2007-04-30 07:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594846, 501841, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, a bit too bright for my taste though, would have appealed more to me a third or even half a stop darker as the colors would have been stronger and the glare on the shell and the pink thing.</td>', 'Nice macro, a bit too bright for my taste though, would have appealed more to me a third or even half a stop darker as the colors would have been stronger and the glare on the shell and the pink thing.', '2007-04-30 07:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594850, 502448, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, you REALLY hit the right moment there and I can´t help but vote this an 8, 95% of that is the moment but lighting and focus is also spot on.  To get a 9 or 10 from me the backround/surroundings would have to be more interesting.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, you REALLY hit the right moment there and I can´t help but vote this an 8, 95% of that is the moment but lighting and focus is also spot on.  To get a 9 or 10 from me the backround/surroundings would have to be more interesting.', '2007-04-30 07:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594854, 501718, 74588, '<td valign="top">what can i say    10</td>', 'what can i say    10', '2007-04-30 07:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594855, 502059, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think that the backround is a bit too distracting here and would have wanted to see it more blurred by any way possible.  Shot not bad though, gave it a 5.</td>', 'I think that the backround is a bit too distracting here and would have wanted to see it more blurred by any way possible.  Shot not bad though, gave it a 5.', '2007-04-30 07:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594856, 502616, 74588, '<td valign="top">nothing to add    10</td>', 'nothing to add    10', '2007-04-30 07:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594857, 502440, 74588, '<td valign="top">8</td>', '8', '2007-04-30 07:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
