(3594878, 502184, 74588, '<td valign="top">8</td>', '8', '2007-04-30 07:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594879, 500797, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too saturated for my taste, when I want really strong colors I bump the contrast instead, did you try that?</td>', 'A bit too saturated for my taste, when I want really strong colors I bump the contrast instead, did you try that?', '2007-04-30 07:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594886, 501020, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot is pretty cool, I dig that the reflections are meshing so well with <br/>each other.  Shot is too dark though, dark enough for me to ask if your monitor is calibrated?  Gave it a 8, I like this a lot and pretty original for this site.</td>', 'This shot is pretty cool, I dig that the reflections are meshing so well with each other.  Shot is too dark though, dark enough for me to ask if your monitor is calibrated?  Gave it a 8, I like this a lot and pretty original for this site.', '2007-04-30 07:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594889, 500419, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, reminds me of a shot I took once for a Macro challenge.  Somehow I think I would have liked this shot better had you gone in even closer but this is still pretty nice.</td>', 'Haha, reminds me of a shot I took once for a Macro challenge.  Somehow I think I would have liked this shot better had you gone in even closer but this is still pretty nice.', '2007-04-30 07:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594890, 501880, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool sky, hard to get it that way with basic editing so well done in that department, I like this shot and gave a 7.</td>', 'Pretty cool sky, hard to get it that way with basic editing so well done in that department, I like this shot and gave a 7.', '2007-04-30 07:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594891, 502567, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but a bit flat contrast wise for my taste.</td>', 'Not bad but a bit flat contrast wise for my taste.', '2007-04-30 07:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594893, 502058, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but the lighting is way way too harsh for my taste, try another angle with the flash next time if you have one you can use off camera, if not I would say use the ambient lighting more next time and less power on the flash.</td>', 'Not bad but the lighting is way way too harsh for my taste, try another angle with the flash next time if you have one you can use off camera, if not I would say use the ambient lighting more next time and less power on the flash.', '2007-04-30 07:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594901, 500858, 27482, '<td valign="top">Stomach is pretty nice but as a photograph, not terribly interesting, I do like these abstract black and white human form studies but you need to play around more with lighting to interest me, side/rim/back lighting usually works best for these kind of shots.</td>', 'Stomach is pretty nice but as a photograph, not terribly interesting, I do like these abstract black and white human form studies but you need to play around more with lighting to interest me, side/rim/back lighting usually works best for these kind of shots.', '2007-04-30 07:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594902, 501734, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well oddly enough I am going to say something I don´t often say but the DOF is too shallow for my taste, having the focus on the petal like that is certainly artistic but not really hitting the spot with me personally.  5</td>', 'Well oddly enough I am going to say something I don´t often say but the DOF is too shallow for my taste, having the focus on the petal like that is certainly artistic but not really hitting the spot with me personally.  5', '2007-04-30 07:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594903, 502074, 27482, '<td valign="top">No kidding, that water looks freezing!</td>', 'No kidding, that water looks freezing!', '2007-04-30 07:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594904, 501051, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot is pretty nice, the coloring is very good.</td>', 'This shot is pretty nice, the coloring is very good.', '2007-04-30 07:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594905, 500241, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a cat photo, lighting perhaps a bit too harsh on the eyes but nice going getting so much detail from black fur, that´s not easy.</td>', 'Not bad for a cat photo, lighting perhaps a bit too harsh on the eyes but nice going getting so much detail from black fur, that´s not easy.', '2007-04-30 07:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594909, 500630, 27482, '<td valign="top">Seen it a LOT of times before but this is a new angle I have seen it from so very well done, looks very tall and majestic.  Whole shot does have a slight magenta/cyan tone to it, I tried opening it in Photoshop and set the color balance to +5 in cyan/red, +10 in magenta/green and -15 in yellow/blue and personally the shot appealed more to me somewhere in that region but that´s always a personal preference of course.  7 from me.</td>', 'Seen it a LOT of times before but this is a new angle I have seen it from so very well done, looks very tall and majestic.  Whole shot does have a slight magenta/cyan tone to it, I tried opening it in Photoshop and set the color balance to +5 in cyan/red, +10 in magenta/green and -15 in yellow/blue and personally the shot appealed more to me somewhere in that region but that´s always a personal preference of course.  7 from me.', '2007-04-30 08:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594912, 500718, 27482, '<td valign="top">There is something about this shot that I like, this probably won´t score well but I bet this would do well with the art crowd.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'There is something about this shot that I like, this probably won´t score well but I bet this would do well with the art crowd.  I gave it a 7.', '2007-04-30 08:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594921, 501827, 27482, '<td valign="top">I do like the thought behind this, the OOF backround but still, it just doesn´t  work this time to intrigue me, lacks something interesting, but by all means continue experiments like this.</td>', 'I do like the thought behind this, the OOF backround but still, it just doesn´t  work this time to intrigue me, lacks something interesting, but by all means continue experiments like this.', '2007-04-30 08:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594922, 501618, 27482, '<td valign="top">The strong yellow/green cast to this shot is not to my personal taste, I would have voted higher had you used a more neutral color balance.</td>', 'The strong yellow/green cast to this shot is not to my personal taste, I would have voted higher had you used a more neutral color balance.', '2007-04-30 08:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594923, 501853, 27482, '<td valign="top">I do like shallow DOF but in this shot it´s a bit too shallow, the bud doesn´t really seem to be in focus, only blotches of it.</td>', 'I do like shallow DOF but in this shot it´s a bit too shallow, the bud doesn´t really seem to be in focus, only blotches of it.', '2007-04-30 08:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594928, 502349, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, you got some very nice tones and texture in there, well lit.</td>', 'Not bad, you got some very nice tones and texture in there, well lit.', '2007-04-30 08:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594935, 501685, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for my taste and could, think an light s-curve or even auto curves would dramatically improve this shot, not bad though.</td>', 'A bit too dark for my taste and could, think an light s-curve or even auto curves would dramatically improve this shot, not bad though.', '2007-04-30 08:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594937, 502464, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this seems a bit effortless and "snapshottish" to me, wouldn´t another angle, perhaps taken from ground level have been more interesting, did you experiment with different angles when taking pictures of this subject?</td>', 'Sorry but this seems a bit effortless and "snapshottish" to me, wouldn´t another angle, perhaps taken from ground level have been more interesting, did you experiment with different angles when taking pictures of this subject?', '2007-04-30 08:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594940, 500763, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hmm, pretty cool/odd, did you paint that tulip or do dual color tulips excist...?  Interesting... :P</td>', 'Hmm, pretty cool/odd, did you paint that tulip or do dual color tulips excist...?  Interesting... :P', '2007-04-30 08:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594942, 501596, 27482, '<td valign="top">Think brightening/upping the contrast with curves would do wonders for this shot, also a bit grainy for my taste but the composition and stance of the Mantis are very good, had the image quality been better there is no knowing what I would given but this got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Think brightening/upping the contrast with curves would do wonders for this shot, also a bit grainy for my taste but the composition and stance of the Mantis are very good, had the image quality been better there is no knowing what I would given but this got a 6 from me.', '2007-04-30 08:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594947, 501308, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the extreme oversaturation of this shot led me to click that "2" button, for me the shot is ruined and only reason I didn´t give a 1 is that it meets the challenge.  No offense intended, just thought you at least deserved to know why I scored that way.</td>', 'Sorry but the extreme oversaturation of this shot led me to click that "2" button, for me the shot is ruined and only reason I didn´t give a 1 is that it meets the challenge.  No offense intended, just thought you at least deserved to know why I scored that way.', '2007-04-30 08:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3594959, 500165, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this needs much better processing to win me over.  Keep in mind night scenes are by nature low contrast so you have to process them accordingly for them to pop, try using shadow highlights and then curves or something similar if you dont have photoshop, that should do the trick.  Also, aurora/lighting/fireworks photos need something more in the frame to really work, try finding and using some foreground next time, by themselves they are not really that interesting.  Sorry for giving you a hard time but I don´t think this shot is bad though, just not good and could have been so much better, I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Sorry but this needs much better processing to win me over.  Keep in mind night scenes are by nature low contrast so you have to process them accordingly for them to pop, try using shadow highlights and then curves or something similar if you dont have photoshop, that should do the trick.  Also, aurora/lighting/fireworks photos need something more in the frame to really work, try finding and using some foreground next time, by themselves they are not really that interesting.  Sorry for giving you a hard time but I don´t think this shot is bad though, just not good and could have been so much better, I gave it a 5.', '2007-04-30 08:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
