(3595236, 500451, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, I do like the colors but seems a bit oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Not bad, I do like the colors but seems a bit oversharpened to me.', '2007-04-30 09:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595262, 501816, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just really have no taste for selective desaturation unless it´s really very originally done with a sense of purpouse (wich I don´t see often and sorry, I don´t see in this picture) so keep in mind I am biased, if you like this just ignore silly old me.  I am not that against it I would vote low just because of that but the shot is what I would call average so I voted a 4 and at least thought I should explain why.</td>', 'Sorry, I just really have no taste for selective desaturation unless it´s really very originally done with a sense of purpouse (wich I don´t see often and sorry, I don´t see in this picture) so keep in mind I am biased, if you like this just ignore silly old me.  I am not that against it I would vote low just because of that but the shot is what I would call average so I voted a 4 and at least thought I should explain why.', '2007-04-30 10:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595264, 502202, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the strong noise is just not to my taste, also I always enjoy street photography more when I can make out faces, expressions or get some emotion from the people in the photo and I just don´t get anything like that from this photo.  3 from me, mostly due to the bad image quality.</td>', 'Sorry but the strong noise is just not to my taste, also I always enjoy street photography more when I can make out faces, expressions or get some emotion from the people in the photo and I just don´t get anything like that from this photo.  3 from me, mostly due to the bad image quality.', '2007-04-30 10:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595277, 502385, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, almost a bit oversharpened for my taste but this is pretty well done technically.</td>', 'Pretty nice, almost a bit oversharpened for my taste but this is pretty well done technically.', '2007-04-30 10:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595281, 502450, 27482, '<td valign="top">Personally this image would appeal more to me if it wasn´t so flat contrast wise, also the flower closest to the camera wich I assume is supposed to be in focus, isn´t, at least not in a very good crisp focus as I would prefer it.</td>', 'Personally this image would appeal more to me if it wasn´t so flat contrast wise, also the flower closest to the camera wich I assume is supposed to be in focus, isn´t, at least not in a very good crisp focus as I would prefer it.', '2007-04-30 10:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595286, 502048, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too noisy in the darker areas of the photo for my taste, other than that, pretty good but I would have cropped off that dark thing in the right side of the frame.</td>', 'A bit too noisy in the darker areas of the photo for my taste, other than that, pretty good but I would have cropped off that dark thing in the right side of the frame.', '2007-04-30 10:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595424, 502534, 74209, '<td valign="top">Very expressive back-lit portrait.  Regardless of any rule of thirds, I like the extra space on his left. It enhances his thoughtful expression and "goes with the game", as it were.  Good work.</td>', 'Very expressive back-lit portrait.  Regardless of any rule of thirds, I like the extra space on his left. It enhances his thoughtful expression and "goes with the game", as it were.  Good work.', '2007-04-30 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595539, 502467, 74209, '<td valign="top">Effective setting for this portrait.  I don''t know, but I think a bit longer depth of field to get the paint in focus would not have detracted.  Still, good work. 7.5, OK 8.</td>', 'Effective setting for this portrait.  I don''t know, but I think a bit longer depth of field to get the paint in focus would not have detracted.  Still, good work. 7.5, OK 8.', '2007-04-30 11:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3595545, 502021, 74209, '<td valign="top">Nostalgic.  Love the deep orange.  Thirds all the way.  Good job. 8</td>', 'Nostalgic.  Love the deep orange.  Thirds all the way.  Good job. 8', '2007-04-30 11:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
