(3596052, 501501, 64521, '<td valign="top">The guy on back is giving me hard time focussing on the little guy''s face..I like everything else about this though.</td>', 'The guy on back is giving me hard time focussing on the little guy''s face..I like everything else about this though.', '2007-04-30 13:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596071, 502692, 39679, '<td valign="top">I normally mark down shots featuring kids because they almost always rely on "cuteness".  Your photo, however, is thoughtfully done - well composed, extremely well lit and tactful.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'I normally mark down shots featuring kids because they almost always rely on "cuteness".  Your photo, however, is thoughtfully done - well composed, extremely well lit and tactful.  Very nice shot.', '2007-04-30 13:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3596094, 502407, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot.  I''d love to see a little less sky and more of the trail.  To my mind the trail is more part of the image, as your subject is actually on it, so the trail deserves more emphasis.  Having said that, I can see that you were trying section the vertical space in thirds (as well as put your subject on a "thirds cross") and my suggestion might upset the composition.  Without seeing it both ways I guess I can''t be sure that my suggestion would work so I''ll just say...Well done.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot.  I''d love to see a little less sky and more of the trail.  To my mind the trail is more part of the image, as your subject is actually on it, so the trail deserves more emphasis.  Having said that, I can see that you were trying section the vertical space in thirds (as well as put your subject on a "thirds cross") and my suggestion might upset the composition.  Without seeing it both ways I guess I can''t be sure that my suggestion would work so I''ll just say...Well done.', '2007-04-30 14:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
