(3596532, 501832, 66353, '<td valign="top">This is great...   You''ve managed to combine a lot of "composition rules" here: Symmetry, rules of thirds, diagonal, centered. triangular, circular - and maybe even more than those. And, your processing is perfect: Light, colors and details are just great.<br/> <br/>9 for now... (and it''s been a while since I voted a 9 in any challenge).</td>', 'This is great...   You''ve managed to combine a lot of "composition rules" here: Symmetry, rules of thirds, diagonal, centered. triangular, circular - and maybe even more than those. And, your processing is perfect: Light, colors and details are just great. 9 for now... (and it''s been a while since I voted a 9 in any challenge).', '2007-04-30 16:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
