(3602340, 501832, 29011, '<td valign="top">A most excellent closeup. Love it :)<br/>This maybe stretching it for thirds though because I see it''s whole face as the subject even though the eyes are on the thirds. Tough one to vote on hmmm. I''m uncertain so I''ll skip voting on this one but wanted to let you know I really like this.</td>', 'A most excellent closeup. Love it :)This maybe stretching it for thirds though because I see it''s whole face as the subject even though the eyes are on the thirds. Tough one to vote on hmmm. I''m uncertain so I''ll skip voting on this one but wanted to let you know I really like this.', '2007-05-01 20:51:40.000000', NULL, 1);
