(3602343, 501875, 50695, '<td valign="top">This looks like bucket''s girl (who is notorious for not cooking for his children. she must make all her own meals. that is why she is soften seen in tragic poses, surrounded by darkness). This also looks like bucket''s flair for an unusual, slightly disorienting but still natural-feeling composition. It''s also got his great b/w tones. Well done. 8</td>', 'This looks like bucket''s girl (who is notorious for not cooking for his children. she must make all her own meals. that is why she is soften seen in tragic poses, surrounded by darkness). This also looks like bucket''s flair for an unusual, slightly disorienting but still natural-feeling composition. It''s also got his great b/w tones. Well done. 8', '2007-05-01 20:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3602345, 500858, 50695, '<td valign="top">I so seldom like a nude. This is brilliant. Completely transformative. The subtle way she fades into the background is *everything*. wow, this required such a subtle, delicate touch and you got it perfect. 10</td>', 'I so seldom like a nude. This is brilliant. Completely transformative. The subtle way she fades into the background is *everything*. wow, this required such a subtle, delicate touch and you got it perfect. 10', '2007-05-01 20:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
