(3604760, 502643, 67697, '<td valign="top">You got two very helpful comments on this pic!  I agree, this is a great idea, and i too think the flash hurt - I think because it creates shadows that do not really add to the picture.  Challenge yourself to take pics without the flash and see what happens!  (use table lamps, natural lighting, flashlights!)</td>', 'You got two very helpful comments on this pic!  I agree, this is a great idea, and i too think the flash hurt - I think because it creates shadows that do not really add to the picture.  Challenge yourself to take pics without the flash and see what happens!  (use table lamps, natural lighting, flashlights!)', '2007-05-02 09:11:01.000000', NULL, 0),
