(3605071, 502070, 3569, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Larus:</b></div><hr/><i> .....  Sky looks a bit odd though, did you brighten the middle part of it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments.  The fog was at an angle that created a "fogbow effect", that is why the light center.  I drove to place the lightened fog between the trees or something interesting. Van<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-04 08:15:49.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Larus: .....  Sky looks a bit odd though, did you brighten the middle part of it?   Thanks for the comments.  The fog was at an angle that created a "fogbow effect", that is why the light center.  I drove to place the lightened fog between the trees or something interesting. Van', '2007-05-02 10:31:10.000000', '2007-05-04 09:15:49.000000', 0),
