(3607910, 499850, 25095, '<td valign="top">wow, very nice capture.  After spending the first 20 years of my life in Colorado and even a cabin up near Winter Park I have only once gotten to see "wild" big horns.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=256434" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/405/thumb/256434.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/405/thumb/256434.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/405/thumb/256434.jpg"/></a> <br/>Up on the edge of Estes on the side of the road.  As I tried to get a little closer they were making some movements that I didn''t feel were friendly so I stepped back lol.<br/> <br/>They are amazing animals and it is even more amazing that you got so close to them.  Great job.</td>', 'wow, very nice capture.  After spending the first 20 years of my life in Colorado and even a cabin up near Winter Park I have only once gotten to see "wild" big horns. Up on the edge of Estes on the side of the road.  As I tried to get a little closer they were making some movements that I didn''t feel were friendly so I stepped back lol. They are amazing animals and it is even more amazing that you got so close to them.  Great job.', '2007-05-02 21:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
