(3607964, 502526, 69493, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JenniferDavidGA:</b></div><hr/><i> 6 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry for this comment during voting.  I downloaded a script to vote with the keypad and it wasn''t working right.  I am going back and commenting on all these I messed up on.<br/> <br/>I love the details that you caught here.  The B&amp;W conversion is perfect.  It seems a bit tilted to me.  Also I don''t see how it meets the ROT.  But it is still a great shot, just not perfect for this challenge.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by JenniferDavidGA: 6   Sorry for this comment during voting.  I downloaded a script to vote with the keypad and it wasn''t working right.  I am going back and commenting on all these I messed up on. I love the details that you caught here.  The B&W conversion is perfect.  It seems a bit tilted to me.  Also I don''t see how it meets the ROT.  But it is still a great shot, just not perfect for this challenge.   ', '2007-05-02 21:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
