(3608030, 500770, 69493, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JenniferDavidGA:</b></div><hr/><i> 5 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry for this comment during voting.  I downloaded a script to vote with the keypad and it was not working correctly.  I came back to comment on all the shots a screwed up on.<br/> <br/>The frame is what bothers me with this shot.  In a print I think the frame would work well but since we are limited on the size of the picture here at DPC the frame takes away from this shot.  It is a wonderful shot.  The B&amp;W conversion is great.</td>', 'Originally posted by JenniferDavidGA: 5   Sorry for this comment during voting.  I downloaded a script to vote with the keypad and it was not working correctly.  I came back to comment on all the shots a screwed up on. The frame is what bothers me with this shot.  In a print I think the frame would work well but since we are limited on the size of the picture here at DPC the frame takes away from this shot.  It is a wonderful shot.  The B&W conversion is great.', '2007-05-02 22:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
