(3608486, 502573, 66384, '<td valign="top">The longer I look at it the better I like it. The soft-focus building in the background gives a nice dimension to the composition. Poor Abe sitting there helplessly. The whole shot in shades of blue and blue-gray except the bird is nice, and really focuses the attention on the irony.</td>', 'The longer I look at it the better I like it. The soft-focus building in the background gives a nice dimension to the composition. Poor Abe sitting there helplessly. The whole shot in shades of blue and blue-gray except the bird is nice, and really focuses the attention on the irony.', '2007-05-02 23:46:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3609186, 502170, 76198, '<td valign="top">seriously underrated (not that a 6.1 is anything to sneeze at). This is a great pic. The amount of bokeh is perfect - emphasizes the main subject while still allowing the background to serve contextually. The duotone works well for it; gives an old-timey feel that I like. Nice work.</td>', 'seriously underrated (not that a 6.1 is anything to sneeze at). This is a great pic. The amount of bokeh is perfect - emphasizes the main subject while still allowing the background to serve contextually. The duotone works well for it; gives an old-timey feel that I like. Nice work.', '2007-05-03 02:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
