(3609410, 502442, 30807, '<td valign="top">What beautiful scenery - I wish I was there - somehow a slightly vandalised council estate just doesn''t do it for me - but there is a wealth of lovely fishing vilages just in a few miles, so I shouldn''t grumble. The grass is always greener, as they say.<br/> <br/>Excellent picture in all respects - well deserved result - We will see more of your shots, I am sure<br/> <br/>Do you have a website with more shots of the area - I would love to see some more!</td>', 'What beautiful scenery - I wish I was there - somehow a slightly vandalised council estate just doesn''t do it for me - but there is a wealth of lovely fishing vilages just in a few miles, so I shouldn''t grumble. The grass is always greener, as they say. Excellent picture in all respects - well deserved result - We will see more of your shots, I am sure Do you have a website with more shots of the area - I would love to see some more!', '2007-05-03 05:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
