(3610780, 502173, 67152, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what people were looking at saying this didn''t follow rule of thirds.  Maybe people are interpreting the rule to apply only in the vertical direction?!<br/> <br/>I gave this a 7 for clearly meeting challenge (in both horiz and vertical, by the way) but that I didn''t find it a ''wow'' photo that could have bumped it up to 8...</td>', 'I am not sure what people were looking at saying this didn''t follow rule of thirds.  Maybe people are interpreting the rule to apply only in the vertical direction?! I gave this a 7 for clearly meeting challenge (in both horiz and vertical, by the way) but that I didn''t find it a ''wow'' photo that could have bumped it up to 8...', '2007-05-03 14:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3610800, 500451, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant!  Great color and definitely meets the challenge.  Great detail in the feathers, too.</td>', 'Very vibrant!  Great color and definitely meets the challenge.  Great detail in the feathers, too.', '2007-05-03 14:36:31.000000', NULL, 0),
