(3610810, 501313, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, great color, love the bokeh.  Really like the look you got from the duck, too.  Light is gorgeous for this shot.</td>', 'Great clarity, great color, love the bokeh.  Really like the look you got from the duck, too.  Light is gorgeous for this shot.', '2007-05-03 14:38:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3610813, 501532, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hard to get this baby in sharp focus because it moves so darn fast!  That said, I think you did a good job with it and I really like the composition.</td>', 'Hard to get this baby in sharp focus because it moves so darn fast!  That said, I think you did a good job with it and I really like the composition.', '2007-05-03 14:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3610819, 500718, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now this is something I like - I''d shoot something like this, too.  The light is quite intriguing and I like the geometry of the lines, both the railing and the shadow.</td>', 'Now this is something I like - I''d shoot something like this, too.  The light is quite intriguing and I like the geometry of the lines, both the railing and the shadow.', '2007-05-03 14:41:11.000000', NULL, 0),
