(5090006, 502693, 63398, '<td valign="top">Subtly spectacular. Love the moodiness and tones.</td>', 'Subtly spectacular. Love the moodiness and tones.', '2008-11-29 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5264295, 502693, 3214, '<td valign="top">Toning into black and white was a good choice on a lot of levels: the mystery, and of course the grey that is yellow-toned in the tail and maybe elsewhere.  The toning keeps our eyes away from the typical pasture unkemptness of the horse, and turns ordinary things like a woodpile and clouds into magical bits.  Congrats on your score!</td>', 'Toning into black and white was a good choice on a lot of levels: the mystery, and of course the grey that is yellow-toned in the tail and maybe elsewhere.  The toning keeps our eyes away from the typical pasture unkemptness of the horse, and turns ordinary things like a woodpile and clouds into magical bits.  Congrats on your score!', '2009-02-19 01:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5577495, 502478, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice! I love the softness.</td>', 'Very, very nice! I love the softness.', '2009-07-17 12:28:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5578921, 502693, 99263, '<td valign="top">I find this quite an exceptional shot composition, lighting and processing wise. Should have placed in the top 3 imo. It has something of an old masters etching to it. I really love it.<br/>Browsed your portfolio whilst i was here and i must add that i am impressed by much of the quality work you have in here. Many different styles and techniques.</td>', 'I find this quite an exceptional shot composition, lighting and processing wise. Should have placed in the top 3 imo. It has something of an old masters etching to it. I really love it.Browsed your portfolio whilst i was here and i must add that i am impressed by much of the quality work you have in here. Many different styles and techniques.', '2009-07-19 08:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5853334, 502693, 110023, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot! The toning gives it a mystical feel. Excellent demonstration of the Rule of Thirds. I love it :)</td>', 'What a beautiful shot! The toning gives it a mystical feel. Excellent demonstration of the Rule of Thirds. I love it :)', '2010-02-04 20:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
